  "description": "Dikili Tash is a prehistoric tell in eastern Macedonia, approximately 1.5 km east of ancient Philippi. The site has been excavated by the \u00c9cole fran\u00e7aise d\u2019Ath\u00e8nes in stages since 1920. Neolithic and Bronze Age deposits have been investigated.",
